For a somewhat more accessible entre to the Hooten & Hobbs monograph, Mevin and I worked up a 'short form' of the subject -- book chapter in a recent book. Lays out Lasso and ridge regression -- and AIC -- in the larger scheme of regularization.  The publishers didn't give us a PDF of the chapter, and the proofs are trash -- here is link to a clean version of the
 chapter: http://canuck.dnr.cornell.edu/research/pubs/pdf/model_selection_review.pdf

